!! v1.3.0 (2026-04-28)

* Added a hover-to-show lazy rendering mode for the bottom reference area, enabled by default to reduce initial render cost on large wikis.
* Added a recent navigation section so the current tiddler can jump back to the tiddler it was just opened from.
* Restored the original backlink, tag folder, slash folder, and backtransclude sections while integrating the new recent navigation block.